此時伐魏。魏不支秦，必東徙。東徙，秦據河山之固，東鄉以制諸侯，此帝王之業也。」孝公以為然，使衛鞅將而伐魏。魏使公子卬將而擊之。軍既相距，衛鞅遺魏將公子卬書曰：「吾始與公子驩，今俱為兩國將，不忍相攻，可與公子面相見，盟，樂飲而罷兵，以安秦魏。」魏公子卬以為然。會盟已，飲，而衛鞅伏甲士而襲虜魏公子卬，因攻其軍，盡破之以歸秦。魏惠王兵數破於齊秦，國內空，日以削，恐，乃使使割河西之地獻於秦以和。而魏遂去安邑，徙都大梁。梁惠王曰：「寡人恨不用公叔座之言也。」衛鞅既破魏還，秦封之於、商十五邑，號為商君。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"太子申","kind":"person","person_id":"b41_mli_il4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"龐涓","kind":"person","person_id":"vk1_9g9_a0u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"衛鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"gy0_w6c_v4l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"pnm_lcu_czk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、泛論或未定指代；不補族群成員、闕代或姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0154","start":154,"end":156,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、泛論或未定指代；不補族群成員、闕代或姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"pnm_lcu_czk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"衛鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"gy0_w6c_v4l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0181","start":181,"end":184,"surface":"公子卬","kind":"person","person_id":"sgl_hjg_o48","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0194","start":194,"end":196,"surface":"衛鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"gy0_w6c_v4l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m008-0199","start":199,"end":202,"surface":"公子卬","kind":"person","person_id":"sgl_hjg_o48","statu