i-068-shang:p010","text":"後五月而秦孝公卒，太子立。公子虔之徒告商君欲反，發吏捕商君。商君亡至關下，欲舍客舍。客人不知其是商君也，曰：「商君之法，舍人無驗者坐之。」商君喟然嘆曰：「嗟乎，為法自斃一至此哉！」去之魏。魏人怨其欺公子卬而破魏師，弗受。商君欲之他國。魏人曰：「商君，秦之賊。秦彊而賊入魏，弗歸，不可。」遂內秦。商君既復入秦，走商邑，與其徒屬發邑兵北出擊鄭。秦發兵攻商君，殺之於鄭黽池。秦惠王車裂商君以徇，曰：「莫如商鞅反者！」遂滅商君之家。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"秦孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"pnm_lcu_czk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"6aj_h39_deu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"公子虔","kind":"person","person_id":"f08_kt7_a71","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"之徒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、泛論或未定指代；不補族群成員、闕代或姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"商君","kind":"person","person_id":"gy0_w6c_v4l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、泛論或未定指代；不補族群成員、闕代或姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"商君","kind":"person","person_id":"gy0_w6c_v4l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"商君","kind":"person","person_id":"gy0_w6c_v4l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"客人","kind":"person","person_id":"04z_mgy_h00","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"商君","kind":"person","person_id":"gy0_w6c_v4l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-068-shang:m010-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"商君","kind":"person","person_id":"gy0_w6c_v4l","status":"contextual_provisional"},